<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-164] Warn when parquet memory manager kicks in</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-164</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-108&quot; title=&quot;Parquet Memory Management in Java&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-108&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-108&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; we implemented a memory manager for parquet. I think we should warn in the close() method if we had to adjust the memory down so that users know their memory is being adjusted down and block size will be less than expected.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12765930">PARQUET-164</key>
            <summary>Warn when parquet memory manager kicks in</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
                                            <priority id="3" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg">Major</priority>
                        <status id="5" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png" description="A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.">Resolved</status>
                    <statusCategory id="3" key="done" colorName="green"/>
                                    <resolution id="1">Fixed</resolution>
                                        <assignee username="dongc">Dong Chen</assignee>
                                    <reporter username="brocknoland">Brock Noland</reporter>
                        <labels>
                    </labels>
                <created>Fri, 9 Jan 2015 02:51:22 +0000</created>
                <updated>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:08 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Tue, 19 May 2015 18:27:52 +0000</resolved>
                                                    <fixVersion>1.8.0</fixVersion>
                                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>4</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14271702" author="brocknoland" created="Fri, 9 Jan 2015 18:54:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thinking about this more, we should increment a counter every time this kicks in. This will allow us to warn the user on the Hive side.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14313300" author="rdblue" created="Tue, 10 Feb 2015 01:01:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr/pull/119&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;PR #119&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14313303" author="rdblue" created="Tue, 10 Feb 2015 01:03:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We&apos;ll have to do the counter idea in a separate issue. I&apos;d like to get the warning in before too many people start hitting this limit without knowing it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14313720" author="rdblue" created="Tue, 10 Feb 2015 07:08:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged PR #119.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14316157" author="dongc" created="Wed, 11 Feb 2015 12:52:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I write a patch about the counter. Will do some cleanup and upload it tomorrow.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14317448" author="dongc" created="Thu, 12 Feb 2015 02:24:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Upload patch about the counter in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr/pull/120&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr/pull/120&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14550956" author="rdblue" created="Tue, 19 May 2015 18:27:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged #120. Thanks, Dong!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857127" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1716&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1716&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
